            "prompt": "Write a synthesis of the two familiar accounts of the request for help. Separate what each source states from your interpretation and preserve the remaining uncertainty.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "Account A: a companion requested help and received no answer, so A thinks the recipient refused. Account B: the recipient may not have understood the request; B has no confirmation. Both accounts report no answer. Write a synthesis that attributes each interpretation and preserves the unknown intention and understanding.\nFamiliar meanings available: to request help; to appeal; companion; comrade; according to; to act in accordance with; to believe; to think.",
